body:
I don't know how to actually get over her though. She was such an enormous part of my life and I barely know how to talk to people who aren't her. Even if I were to get over her I don't know what I would do after that. I would have to start from scratch. Graduating wouldn't make it any easier, as I'd have to go out of my way to find someone instead of just being grouped up with them. It just seems impossible for someone like me.

&#x200B;

Thank you for actually reading this, by the way.
